{"code":"288330","name":"파라택시스코리아","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"제약","sector_desc":"의약품을 개발·생산·판매. 신약 파이프라인과 임상 결과, 약가 정책에 주가가 크게 반응합니다.","desc":"동사는 2015년 기초 의약물질 제조를 목적으로 설립되고, 2019년 코스닥에 상장함. 2025년 파라택시스홀딩스로부터 유상증자를 통해 디지털자산 사업부를 신설하고, 비트코인을 전략적 재무자산으로 채택하여 바이오사업과 이원화된 사업구조를 구축함. 디지털자산 사업부는 비트코인 매입·보유 및 자체 채굴을 추진하며, 바이오사업부는 특발성 폐섬유증 등 미충족 의료수요 질환의 혁신 신약 연구개발과 기술이전하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-29","n_days":300,"close":416.0,"open":416.0,"high":416.0,"low":416.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":0.0,"ret_250":-72.5775,"ma20":416.0,"ma60":416.0,"ma120":416.0,"ma200":547.615,"close_vs_ma200":-24.0342,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":0.0,"slope_120":0.0,"r2_120":0.0,"slope_250":-73.3798,"r2_250":0.7837,"high52":1731.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":24.0324,"dd_52w":-75.9676,"mdd_1y":-73.2476,"atr14_pct":28.5714,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":null,"vr20":0.0,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":31.0212,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":0.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0,"foreign_ratio":51.78,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.01,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-22.0,"op_margin_q":-244.4444,"op_qoq":-4.7619,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":53.1915,"rev_yoy":null,"op_trend_4q":14.6939,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-79.67,"debt_ratio":59.13,"per":null,"pbr":1.22,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":51.78,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"cns_per":null,"code":"288330","name":"파라택시스코리아","market":"KO